{"parse": {"title": "风暴前夜-05", "pageid": 128096, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%9C-04\" title=\"风暴前夜-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">风暴前夜-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%A4%9C-06\" title=\"风暴前夜-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">风暴前夜</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.8D.A3.E8.AA.89.E7.9A.84.E5.9B.9A.E5.BE.92\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"荣誉的囚徒\">荣誉的囚徒</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 荣誉的囚徒</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Prisoner of Honor</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_3_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_3_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/04/Cg-3_3_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_3_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我觉得，刚才的老人家鼻子歪得像我父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白马雀跃地朝前跑了几步，和佩伦并排，士兵的话清晰地传到了伊戈尔耳朵里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>他去参军以后就没再回来，回来的时候只有一封信和一枚奖章，说他在战场上牺牲了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我记得他从来不好好做祷告，避战符对他没用。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>祖母说我继承了父亲的歪鼻子，她每天都祈祷我别继承父亲的坏运气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>佩伦高高地仰起头，发出一声响亮的鼻音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>冷静点，乖孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔俯下身，安抚地拍了拍红马的脖子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你父亲是个很优秀的战士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>我知道的，将军。这也是我参军的原因。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>事情总是这样。我年轻的时候，也想成为我父亲那样的战士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>卫国战争的时候他是骑兵团长，每天晚上，他都会给我讲那场战役，那座城市。那就是我的睡前故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>城市里的每一条街，每一栋楼，每一个人，不管是活着还是死去的，都在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔指了指自己的脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>比我童年的任何记忆都要清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f2/HeadIconSmall-531501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">格里高利：</div><div>您父亲也是位很优秀的战士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将军没有回应，他低下头思考了一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我父亲教会了我骑马，教我怎么射击抛到空中的酒瓶，怎么在错马的瞬间攻击敌人的左侧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>他教给我一个士兵需要知道的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>伊戈尔握紧缰绳，把重心微微后移，佩伦收到他的信号，放缓了脚步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"309201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"309201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>但事实是，中士，我不知道他是不是一个合格的战士。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-senlin_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"senlin_ye\"><img alt=\"senlin_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/600px-Cg-senlin_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/900px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/22/Cg-senlin_ye.png/1200px-Cg-senlin_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一排酒瓶被摆在白桦树叶覆盖的地上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>均匀地，平缓地……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年把手指放在扳机上，吸入一口气，缓慢呼出。在这口气结束，短暂屏息的瞬间，射击者的身体最为稳定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就是现在——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>冲锋——全体士兵——冲锋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>身后传来重物坠地的声音，酒瓶也在同一瞬间砸在地上，发出刺耳的碎裂声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>父亲……瓦西里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>青年放下枪，扶起自己醉醺醺的父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不是个轻松的差使，瓦西里退伍后依然魁梧得像一座山。何况他还在发出野兽样的吼声，手还在空中挥舞着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>用燃烧瓶扔他们的坦克！好样的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他甩开伊戈尔的手，站得笔直，眼睛里闪烁着清醒的、火一样的光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>叶戈尔在楼顶压制重火力组，瓦列里带人突入一楼大厅！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>炸药……炸药……爆破组呢？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>您不能这样喝酒了，瓦西里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>父亲没有听见他的话，他转头寻找着本应响起的爆炸。但只有风拂过白桦树的叶子，发出哭歌一样的呜呜声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>白雾漫上瓦西里浑浊的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>叶戈尔……从楼上掉下来了，我没法把他的尸体带回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>我的枪，子弹打光了，见鬼的，我的枪呢……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>您不能再用枪了，瓦西里，醉鬼的手不稳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>放屁！我就是用这把枪，打掉了五十个德国兵，守住了那栋楼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>我的枪丢了……不行，我没法再往前了，死神正在看着我……太冷了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>主啊，求您怜悯狂妄的仆从……他冻僵的手指再也拿不住枪……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>酒，我的酒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓦西里跪在地上，像狗一样将头埋在破碎的酒瓶碎片里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>酒液已经渗进落叶下的土地，他再也舔不到一滴伏特加。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>瓦西里！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>山一样的老兵被青年拎着领子从地上拽了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你还是一个战士吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>你不是骑兵团长吗？是什么东西吓破了你的胆子？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓦西里摇晃着脑袋，睁开红肿的眼皮，试图看清眼前的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>你不明白……你没有上过战场，你不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我明天就要上战场了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>明天，我就会出发去前线。无论遇见什么敌人，我都会第一个往前冲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>如果回头，如果我犹豫一秒，我宁愿被自己的战友打死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓦西里终于完全睁开了眼睛，他看着眼前的青年，有和自己一样的灰色眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>你没上过战场。你知道烧焦的人肉闻起来是什么味道吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>甜丝丝的，但多闻一秒，你的鼻子、喉咙，就会被这恶心的味道噎住，怎么也抠不出来，你会带着这股味道一直到死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>你知道骨头碎掉是什么声音吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>脆的，就像掰断冻树枝，像踩碎冰面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>你不知道，年轻人，你什么都不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人不为所动，他静静地站在原地，像一棵未经过霜冻的白桦树。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我什么都不知道，所以我会一直前进，绝不后退一步。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"532020.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"532020.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1b/HeadIconSmall-532020.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-532020.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">伊戈尔：</div><div>我会取得胜利。无论对面是魔鬼，还是死神。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>多么勇敢……但是个不折不扣的蠢货。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>醉鬼还是没有认出自己的儿子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他后退两步，眯起眼睛打量这个树一样的青年，和他手里的枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后他嘻嘻地笑了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>让醉鬼传授你一个胜利的诀窍吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>你要畏惧死亡，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/HeadIconSmall-531601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">瓦西里：</div><div>不仅畏惧自己的死亡，你要畏惧每一个人的死亡。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "风暴前夜-05"}}